@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9


[PrintTextModified Text:在场的每一名少女<br>按下按钮时都充满了痛苦，肝肠寸断。|#0203Adv14_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也一样。|#0203Adv14_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
