[PrintTextModified Text:我还有疑问。|#0203Adv14_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在这个令人难以忍受的氛围之下，<br>艾玛突然开口说道。|#0203Adv14_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚跟安安……<br>她们为什么会想到要做这种<br>像恶作剧似的事情呢……？|#0203Adv14_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚，你问过安安为什么，<br>对吗……？|#0203Adv14_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Ema-Front Loop:false
@HideActors ActorIds:Ema-Front Lazy:false
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle SubId:Front LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……|#0203Adv14_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚看起来很落寞。<br>她低着头，向我们说出了当时跟安安的对话。|#0203Adv14_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

