[PrintTextModified Text:当只有两个人待在地下的房间时，<br>安安经常都会想办法<br>逗诺亚开心。|#0203Adv14_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就是在那个时候，<br>安安说出了装死这个恶作剧计划。|#0203Adv14_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——怎么样？很好玩对吧！|#0203Adv14_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯嗯嗯！<br>这肯定能吓到大家！|#0203Adv14_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安真厉害！<br>诺亚可想不出来这种恶作剧。|#0203Adv14_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Flushed

[PrintTextModified Text:哼哼。|#0203Adv14_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:大家每天都在为不知何时会发生的凶杀案担惊受怕。|#0203Adv14_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:就让吾辈来打破这种氛围。<br>吾辈要弄一场虚假的凶杀案，让大家一笑了之。|#0203Adv14_AnAn004| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:得意洋洋一番以后，<br>安安带着些许羞涩的神情别过头。|#0203Adv14_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Flushed

[PrintTextModified Text:……吾辈不是说过了吗，一定会让你笑起来的。|#0203Adv14_AnAn005| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

