[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅平心定气地问道。<br>可是诺亚听到这个问题，却像在闹别扭似的撇着嘴不说话。|#0203Adv14_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1 SubId:Middle

