[PrintTextModified Text:因为……|#0203Adv14_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:脸上依然挂着不服神情的诺亚垂下了眼。|#0203Adv14_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Cry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:因为安安她……<br>看到了诺亚的画……|#0203Adv14_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在场的少女都陷入了困惑。|#0203Adv14_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@SpawnExtended Path:MaskingRectangle Params:40,200,true,0.3,#000000 ScenePosition:20,50 Rotation:,,0 SubId:Front
