@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Miria-Front Loop:false ScenePositionY:45 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.5
@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚的画……<br>大家平时都在看呀？|#0203Adv14_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Miria-Front Loop:false
@HideActors ActorIds:Miria-Front Lazy:false
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle SubId:Front LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:不管是监牢随处可见的涂鸦，<br>还是素描本上的插画，<br>甚至舞台背景。|#0203Adv14_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚平时就总是自豪地向大家炫耀自己的画作。<br>|#0203Adv14_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但这时候她却把“安安看到她的画”作为杀人理由——<br>简直无法理解。|#0203Adv14_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……那些啊，其实都不是诺亚画的。|#0203Adv14_Noah009| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:突如其来的是一句轻声的自白。|#0203Adv14_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安清清楚楚地坦白了，<br>所以诺亚也得说出来才行呢。|#0203Adv14_Noah010| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，诺亚骗了大家。<br>可是呢，那都是因为，诺亚画的画其实都很难看。|#0203Adv14_Noah011| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她泫然欲泣地笑着说。|#0203Adv14_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚实在说不出口……|#0203Adv14_Noah012| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:带着一定要在这里说出来的决心。|#0203Adv14_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚不是有意去害人，<br>也不是在闹别扭。|#0203Adv14_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.15 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Cry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚……好害怕。|#0203Adv14_Noah013| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚就这样，<br>把她的【禁忌】曝光在我们面前。|#0203Adv14_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她那漆黑的感情，逐渐把我们的心也染上阴暗的颜色。|#0203Adv14_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

