[PrintTextModified Text:城崎诺亚从很久以前开始<br>就非常喜欢画画。|#0203Adv14_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她总是在狭小的房间里，<br>拿传单的背面当画纸，终日画画度过一整天。|#0203Adv14_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有一次，她苦苦哀求妈妈，<br>给她买了一些画具。|#0203Adv14_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:4.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:0,-10 AppearanceAndTransition:240_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:她非常珍惜这些画具，<br>用它们画出了各种各样的画作。|#0203Adv14_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——画画真开心！最喜欢画画了！|#0203Adv14_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:房间里放满了自己的画作，<br>诺亚幸福得笑容满面。|#0203Adv14_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，她的身上突然发生了巨变。<br>诺亚觉醒了魔法。|#0203Adv14_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:某天外出的时候，<br>诺亚看到几个人在建筑物的墙面上画画。|#0203Adv14_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她请求人家让自己动手试试，那几个人答应了。<br>那时的诺亚充满了信心。|#0203Adv14_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚自信的来源，就是魔法。<br>魔法会让诺亚的画变好看。|#0203Adv14_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自那以后，没过多久。|#0203Adv14_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚用魔法画出来的画作成为了热门话题，<br>就连媒体也报道了她的画。|#0203Adv14_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚的画作转眼间就闻名于世。|#0203Adv14_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚很骄傲。诺亚很开心。<br>所有人都会夸奖她的画。|#0203Adv14_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——可是，不管诺亚的画作名气有多大，<br>她都从未公开宣布自己就是作者。|#0203Adv14_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为在她心底的某个角落里一直有一份担忧。|#0203Adv14_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每次回到家，<br>她都不得不面对摆在眼前的现实。|#0203Adv14_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:摆放在房间里的，以前自己亲手画的画。<br>没有使用魔法的，自己的画。|#0203Adv14_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:100,50 AppearanceAndTransition:240_1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:每当诺亚想要画出新的画作时，<br>诺亚的魔法就会把她之前的画作一张一张涂黑。|#0203Adv14_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:丑死了。<br>丑死了。|#0203Adv14_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:丑死了。丑死了。丑死了。丑死了。|#0203Adv14_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔法把现实推到诺亚面前。<br>诺亚亲手画的画无人需要。|#0203Adv14_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就这样，<br>诺亚亲手画的画全都被涂成一片黑色了。|#0203Adv14_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:240_1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:——啊哈哈，没错。<br>——诺亚不需要这种看了就羞愧的画。诺亚最讨厌这些画了。|#0203Adv14_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚与魔法产生共鸣，发出空洞的笑声。<br>在笑容的掩盖下，她的心也感到阵阵刺痛。|#0203Adv14_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经不需要这些亲手一笔笔画出来的画了。|#0203Adv14_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——没有人会喜欢这么丑的画。|#0203Adv14_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:绝对不会有人喜欢。因为连诺亚本人都变得不喜欢了。|#0203Adv14_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

