[PrintTextModified Text:像是一个水族箱一般的——水槽。|#0203Adv14_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大小看起来能轻松容纳一名少女。<br>里面大概装了八成满的水。|#0203Adv14_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——诺亚即将被处死。<br>这个事实就像一块巨石，重重地压在我的心头。|#0203Adv14_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果能做到，我真想马上制止。<br>感情正在激烈地波动。|#0203Adv14_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不能原谅典狱长和看守。<br>不，就连其他少女，甚至我自己，我都无法原谅。|#0203Adv14_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对诺亚处以死刑，是错误的——|#0203Adv14_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:事到如今也不用我多说了吧？<br>请各位留在原地，切勿乱动。|#0203Adv14_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仿佛看透我此时的心境一般，<br>典狱长这般说道。|#0203Adv14_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一旦谁做出妨碍或介入处刑的行为，<br>就会被看守当场处死。|#0203Adv14_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:若轻举妄动，<br>说不定会让更多人牺牲。|#0203Adv14_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我咬紧牙关。<br>不能再这样下去了。|#0203Adv14_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希——|#0203Adv14_Noah018| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被看守带上处刑台的诺亚，<br>往我这边瞥了一眼。|#0203Adv14_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的嘴巴张了张，仿佛有话要说，<br>但结果还是没能说出任何话。|#0203Adv14_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在前阵子，<br>我见到过诺亚做出同样的举动。|#0203Adv14_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（诺亚到底想对我说什么……）|#0203Adv14_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 鎖が垂れ下がる音
