@Wait WaitMode:2
@StopBgm BgmPath:Ambi_10_1

[PrintTextModified Text:悬垂的锁链扣住了诺亚。|#0203Adv14_Narrative071| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 鎖が垂れ下がる音
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_10_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.5 Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:460_2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:在受到拘束的状态下，<br>诺亚的身体逐渐没入水槽之中。|#0203Adv14_Narrative072| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm BgmPath:Ambi_10_1

[PrintTextModified Text:和诺亚共度的无数回忆犹如走马灯一般<br>在脑海中浮现。|#0203Adv14_Narrative073| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:就在这时候——我终于明白过来。|#0203Adv14_Narrative074| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

