[PrintTextModified Text:不能在这里画吗？|#0203Adv14_Noah020| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不行。|#0203Adv14_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1,ArmR1,ArmL2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:小气鬼～|#0203Adv14_Noah021| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:随你怎么说。只要我在，<br>就不许你恣意妄为。|#0203Adv14_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

