[PrintTextModified Text:……最讨厌希罗了。|#0203Adv14_Noah023| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:讨厌就讨厌吧。<br>这都怪诺亚做出不正确的行为！|#0203Adv14_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

