@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_43_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:——诺亚！！|#0203Adv14_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我无法忍耐，飞奔出去，大喊起来。|#0203Adv14_Narrative075| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:厚厚的玻璃像一道天堑把我们隔开，<br>我只能隔着玻璃和诺亚对视。|#0203Adv14_Narrative076| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我……我……|#0203Adv14_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:曾经诺亚连饭也不吃，<br>一直闷在地下牢房。<br>带着她走出牢房，到外面去的，是我。|#0203Adv14_Narrative077| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:牵着她的手，<br>一直守护着她的，是我。|#0203Adv14_Narrative078| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚总是欲言又止，那一定是因为——<br>诺亚在等待我走近她的身边。|#0203Adv14_Narrative079| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她一直在等我。|#0203Adv14_Narrative080| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,60 AppearanceAndTransition:460_4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我不会不管你！！|#0203Adv14_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我直视着诺亚，声嘶力竭地大喊起来。<br>|#0203Adv14_Narrative081| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:朋友做了坏事，我会斥责她；<br>朋友做了错误的事，就算她反感，我也会帮助她改正！|#0203Adv14_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:觉得我烦人也好，觉得我讨厌也好，<br>但我就是这样的人！|#0203Adv14_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果你愿意的话，我们就言归于好——！|#0203Adv14_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗……|#0203Adv14_Noah024| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算你不愿意……<br>我也绝对不会不管你……！！|#0203Adv14_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不会放弃你！！|#0203Adv14_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚的脸颊划过一丝泪痕。|#0203Adv14_Narrative082| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她流着泪，无声地，<br>一次又一次地点头。|#0203Adv14_Narrative083| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,60 AppearanceAndTransition:460_5 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你，希罗。|#0203Adv14_Noah025| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其实诺亚，一直想，能好好地，<br>跟希罗和好……|#0203Adv14_Noah026| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直想，跟希罗说一声，对不起……|#0203Adv14_Noah027| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还有安安，<br>诺亚好害怕，害怕得受不了……|#0203Adv14_Noah028| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明不希望再有人死去……<br>却想着一定要杀死她不可……！|#0203Adv14_Noah029| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,60 AppearanceAndTransition:460_6 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:心里明明抗拒……却无法抑制这些感情……！|#0203Adv14_Noah030| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，对不起！！<br>真的，对不起……！！|#0203Adv14_Noah031| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚心里一直有我。<br>她一直在等我。|#0203Adv14_Narrative084| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:痛苦袭来的同时，也深刻感受到我们之间的联结。|#0203Adv14_Narrative085| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我终于能感受到，我们的心是如此地靠近。|#0203Adv14_Narrative086| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,60 AppearanceAndTransition:460_7 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:水位越来越满，诺亚逐渐下沉。|#0203Adv14_Narrative087| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:隔着玻璃，摇曳的水光让她的轮廓变得模糊。<br>|#0203Adv14_Narrative088| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每一分每一秒都漫长得宛如永恒。|#0203Adv14_Narrative089| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……可是啊，其实诺亚也有高兴过。|#0203Adv14_Noah032| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安对诺亚说，<br>她喜欢诺亚亲手画的画……|#0203Adv14_Noah033| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,60 AppearanceAndTransition:460_8 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:所以，其实诺亚也很想给希罗看一看。|#0203Adv14_Noah034| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看看诺亚画的画，夸夸真正属于诺亚的画作。|#0203Adv14_Noah035| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚……！|#0203Adv14_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不禁挥起拳头<br>试图打碎玻璃。|#0203Adv14_Narrative090| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，不行……！|#0203Adv14_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:身后，艾玛抓住我的手腕，阻止了我。|#0203Adv14_Narrative091| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……！|#0203Adv14_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我知道。<br>已经无法阻止处刑了。|#0203Adv14_Narrative092| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:460_9 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:我咬紧嘴唇，目不转睛地看着诺亚。|#0203Adv14_Narrative093| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我再也不会从你身上移开视线。<br>　我会看着你，直到最后一刻）|#0203Adv14_Hiro019|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:460_10 SubId:Front

@ResetText

; 水が泡立つ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_142 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:喂，这不对劲……|#0203Adv14_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:水中突然翻涌出大量的泡沫，<br>逐渐掩盖诺亚全身。|#0203Adv14_Narrative094| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不。看起来像是诺亚的身体正在化成泡沫，<br>逐渐溶解。|#0203Adv14_Narrative095| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:难不成……这不是普通的水？|#0203Adv14_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

; 水が泡立つ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_142 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚微笑着，看着我的眼睛。<br>那是她留给我最后的画面。|#0203Adv14_Narrative096| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚的嘴唇缓缓地动作。|#0203Adv14_Narrative097| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——希罗。|#0203Adv14_Narrative098| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——诺亚最喜欢你了。|#0203Adv14_Narrative099| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——说讨厌你，都是假的。|#0203Adv14_Narrative100| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:都这个时候了……！|#0203Adv14_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算你不说……<br>我也知道……！|#0203Adv14_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:460_11 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:终于，泡沫消散——|#0203Adv14_Narrative101| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:水槽里早已不见诺亚的身影。|#0203Adv14_Narrative102| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她就像融化在水里一般，没有留下一点痕迹。|#0203Adv14_Narrative103| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_44_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:……这可麻烦了。<br>就当处刑已经执行完毕好了。|#0203Adv14_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:似乎连典狱长也没有想到，<br>诺亚竟然会完全消失。|#0203Adv14_Narrative104| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……算了，就当是那么一回事吧。<br>魔女审判，就此闭庭！|#0203Adv14_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 歯車がまわる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_36 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:机关随即动作起来，缓缓地把水槽移动至地下。|#0203Adv14_Narrative105| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（诺亚……你在那里面吗？）|#0203Adv14_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只能呆呆望着不断摇晃的水面。|#0203Adv14_Narrative106| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

